collection, then record the individual pieces you want to remember.

3
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:21,128
Let's add a blue sapphire. Give the piece a recognizable name, describe what matters
to you,

4
00:00:21,128 --> 00:00:28,216
and record where you keep it. Notes and storage location are optional. Save item
opens the

5
00:00:28,216 --> 00:00:31,316
complete saved record, including its permanent identifier.

6
00:00:32,737 --> 00:00:39,589
Return to the collection and open the sapphire again. Refreshing keeps its notes and
tray location

7
00:00:39,589 --> 00:00:46,441
intact. The walkthrough also checks a separate authenticated session against the same
database, so this is

8
00:00:46,441 --> 00:00:49,438
